### 1.2 â€” Checklist tá»± kiá»ƒm tra

```bash
# Em cháº¡y tá»± Ä‘á»™ng:
check_file() {
  [ -f "index.html" ] && echo "âœ… TÃªn file OK" || echo "âŒ Äá»•i tÃªn â†’ index.html"
  grep -q "<!DOCTYPE html>" index.html && echo "âœ… DOCTYPE" || echo "âš ï¸ Thiáº¿u DOCTYPE"
  grep -qi "charset" index.html && echo "âœ… Charset" || echo "âš ï¸ Thiáº¿u charset"
  grep -qi "viewport" index.html && echo "âœ… Viewport" || echo "âš ï¸ Thiáº¿u viewport"
