### Em tá»± Ä‘á»™ng deploy

```bash
VERCEL_TOKEN="[token]"
REPO_NAME="[repo]"
USERNAME="[github username]"

DEPLOY_RESPONSE=$(curl -s -X POST "https://api.vercel.com/v13/deployments" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $VERCEL_TOKEN" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d "{\"name\":\"$REPO_NAME\",\"gitSource\":{\"type\":\"github\",\"repo\":\"$USERNAME/$REPO_NAME\",\"ref\":\"main\"},\"target\":\"production\"}")

DEPLOY_ID=$(echo $DEPLOY_RESPONSE | python3 -c "import json,sys; print(json.load(sys.stdin).get('id',''))")
DEPLOY_URL=$(echo $DEPLOY_RESPONSE | python3 -c "import json,sys; print(json.load(sys.stdin).get('url',''))")

# Polling build status
for i in $(seq 1 20); do
    sleep 15
    STATUS=$(curl -s "https://api.vercel.com/v13/deployments/$DEPLOY_ID" \
      -H "Authorization: Bearer $VERCEL_TOKEN" | \
      python3 -c "import json,sys; print(json.load(sys.stdin).get('readyState',''))")
    echo "Láº§n $i: $STATUS"
    [ "$STATUS" = "READY" ] && echo "âœ… LIVE: https://$DEPLOY_URL" && break
    [ "$STATUS" = "ERROR" ] && echo "âŒ Build lá»—i â€” Ä‘á»c log sá»­a..." && break
done
```

### Báº£ng lá»—i Vercel

| Lá»—i | Em xá»­ lÃ½ |
|---|---|
| 404 NOT_FOUND khi reload | Táº¡o/sá»­a vercel.json rewrites |
| Build failed - no output | Kiá»ƒm tra index.html á»Ÿ root |
| Module not found | Sá»­a import paths |
| Function size exceeded | Chuyá»ƒn sang static |

