### â•â•â•â• Há»† THá»NG I â€” Báº¢O Máº¬T ÄA Lá»šP (SECURITY STACK) â•â•â•â•

**I.1 â€” XÃC THá»°C & PHÃ‚N QUYá»€N (Auth & Authorization)**
