### â•â•â•â• Há»† THá»NG II â€” Cáº¬P NHáº¬T Tá»° Äá»˜NG & Báº¢O TRÃŒ (AUTO-UPDATE PIPELINE) â•â•â•â•

**II.1 â€” DEPENDENCY MANAGEMENT**
