- **npm audit / pip-audit / cargo audit**: cháº¡y tá»± Ä‘á»™ng trong CI/CD, block merge náº¿u cÃ³ CVE Critical/High
- **Lock file** báº¯t buá»™c (`package-lock.json`, `poetry.lock`): Ä‘áº£m báº£o reproducible builds
- **Semantic Versioning (SemVer)** nghiÃªm ngáº·t cho má»i module ná»™i bá»™

**II.2 â€” CI/CD PIPELINE AN TOÃ€N (Secure DevOps)**
- **GitHub Actions** vá»›i cÃ¡c jobs báº¯t buá»™c:
  - `security-scan`: Snyk/CodeQL SAST scan toÃ n bá»™ source code
  - `test`: unit test (â‰¥80% coverage) + integration test
  - `lint`: ESLint, Prettier, Flake8
  - `build`: Vercel build preview tá»± Ä‘á»™ng má»—i Pull Request
  - `deploy`: git push â†’ Vercel tá»± Ä‘á»™ng deploy Production (zero downtime, instant rollback)
- **Vercel Preview Deployments**: má»—i PR/branch sinh 1 URL preview riÃªng Ä‘á»ƒ test trÆ°á»›c
- **Secret Scanning**: GitHub Secret Scanner + pre-commit hooks (detect API keys, passwords)
- **Signed Commits**: GPG signing cho production deployments

**II.3 â€” DATABASE MIGRATION & VERSIONING**
- **Supabase Migrations** (Flyway/Liquibase pattern): má»i thay Ä‘á»•i schema Ä‘á»u cÃ³ migration file
- **Backward-Compatible Migrations**: khÃ´ng breaking change, há»— trá»£ rollback
- **Automated Backup**: Supabase point-in-time recovery + backup hÃ ng ngÃ y ra S3/R2
- **Zero-Downtime Deployment**: expand-contract pattern cho schema changes

**II.4 â€” MONITORING & OBSERVABILITY**
- **Health Check Endpoint** `/health` + `/ready`: Vercel tá»± Ä‘á»™ng restart serverless function náº¿u unhealthy; UptimeRobot ping má»—i 5 phÃºt
- **Uptime Monitoring**: BetterUptime/UptimeRobot + cáº£nh bÃ¡o Telegram khi downtime
- **Performance Budget**: Lighthouse CI trong pipeline â€” fail build náº¿u score <85
- **PostHog Analytics**: track feature usage, error rates, conversion funnel
- **Structured Logging (JSON)**: Winston/Pino vá»›i log levels; ship logs tá»›i Loki/CloudWatch

**II.5 â€” Tá»° Äá»˜NG HÃ“A Báº¢O TRÃŒ (Automated Maintenance)**
- **Cron Jobs tá»± Ä‘á»™ng**: dá»n dáº¹p session háº¿t háº¡n, purge soft-deleted records, rotate logs
- **Feature Flags (LaunchDarkly/Unleash)**: deploy tÃ­nh nÄƒng má»›i khÃ´ng cáº§n redeploy; rollback tá»©c thÃ¬
- **Automated Rollback**: náº¿u error rate >5% sau deploy â†’ tá»± Ä‘á»™ng rollback phiÃªn báº£n trÆ°á»›c
- **Self-Healing**: Vercel Auto-Restart serverless functions + CircuitBreaker pattern cho external APIs

