## 2. QUY TRÃŒNH THá»°C HIá»†N

### 2.1 BÆ°á»›c 1 â€” Setup mÃ´i trÆ°á»ng Python

```python
# BÆ¯á»šC Äáº¦U TIÃŠN: Patch openpyxl Ä‘á»ƒ Ä‘á»c file bá»‹ lá»—i drawing NULL
import openpyxl.packaging.relationship as rel_mod
def safe_get(self, key):
    for r in self:
        if r.Id == key: return r
    return None
rel_mod.RelationshipList.get = safe_get
import importlib, openpyxl.reader.drawings, openpyxl.reader.excel, openpyxl
for m in [openpyxl.reader.drawings, openpyxl.reader.excel, openpyxl]:
    importlib.reload(m)

# Fix file lá»—i drawing trÆ°á»›c khi load
import zipfile, re, shutil

def fix_and_load(src_path):
    """Fix NULL drawing references vÃ  load workbook"""
    dst = '/home/claude/working.xlsx'
    with zipfile.ZipFile(src_path, 'r') as zin:
        with zipfile.ZipFile(dst, 'w', zipfile.ZIP_DEFLATED) as zout:
            for item in zin.infolist():
                data = zin.read(item.filename)
                if item.filename.endswith('.rels') and b'NULL' in data:
                    text = data.decode('utf-8')
                    text = re.sub(r'<Relationship[^>]*Target="NULL"[^/]*/>', '', text)
                    data = text.encode('utf-8')
                zout.writestr(item, data)
    return openpyxl.load_workbook(dst)
```

### 2.2 BÆ°á»›c 2 â€” XÃ¡c Ä‘á»‹nh thÃ¡ng hiá»‡n táº¡i cá»§a file

```python
def get_last_month(wb):
    """TÃ¬m thÃ¡ng/nÄƒm cuá»‘i cÃ¹ng cá»§a file (sheet Báº¢NG CHIáº¾N LÆ¯á»¢C CHI má»›i nháº¥t)"""
    import re
    pattern = r'Báº¢NG CHIáº¾N LÆ¯á»¢C CHI\s+(\d+)\.(\d{4})'
    last = (0, 0)
    for s in wb.sheetnames:
        m = re.match(pattern, s.strip())
        if m:
            mon, yr = int(m.group(1)), int(m.group(2))
            if (yr, mon) > last:
                last = (yr, mon)
    return last  # (year, month)
```

### 2.3 BÆ°á»›c 3 â€” Há»i thÃ´ng tin trÆ°á»›c khi táº¡o sheet má»›i

Khi báº¯t Ä‘áº§u lÃ m viá»‡c vá»›i thÃ¡ng {n}, Claude PHáº¢I há»i:

**CÃ¢u há»i 1 â€” Vá» lá»›p há»c:**
```
